# GM-40 real draft catalogue, dish-session-v3/ADR-019; QA only, schema0.8.0/0026.
# Automated setup/content assertions/cleanup: python3 scripts/gm40_catalogue_check.py
# The runner owns an ephemeral PostgREST/DB, signs synthetic QA-user JWTs in memory,
# runs verified worker, then removes both. These placeholders are a manual contract
# reference; they are not credentials or an endpoint left running after the check.
# baseUrl = gateway origin + /rest/v1, OR isolated QA PostgREST origin (no /rest/v1).
# NEVER point at production or assume local application DB has migration0026.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:QA_REST_PORT
@guestJwt = QA_HOST_JWT
@outsiderJwt = QA_OUTSIDER_JWT
@requestId = NEW_UUID_FOR_CREATE
@roomId = UUID_FROM_CREATE

### Real lunch pool: expected ok=true, exactly20 distinct cards with lunch tag.
# Every card's dishId/name/description/artwork/mealSlots/cuisineIds/categoryIds must
# match imported bundle projection; catalogueVersion=dish-catalogue-v1:1.1.0,
# catalogueSha=manifest.bundleSha256; testData=true. No venue/GPS fields required.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/dish_session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestJwt}}

{"command":"create","payload":{"requestId":"{{requestId}}","displayName":"GM40 QA host","dishCount":20,"mealSlot":"lunch"}}

### Retry identical create: same request/body must keep room/pool, no second room.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/dish_session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestJwt}}

{"command":"create","payload":{"requestId":"{{requestId}}","displayName":"GM40 QA host","dishCount":20,"mealSlot":"lunch"}}

### Member readback: pool/release/hash pinned, own ballot only.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/dish_session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestJwt}}

{"command":"snapshot","payload":{"roomId":"{{roomId}}"}}

### Known shortage: 7 dinner-tagged dishes cannot supply20.
# Expected HTTP200, ok=false, error.messageKey=INSUFFICIENT_DISHES, not7/20 cards.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/dish_session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{guestJwt}}

{"command":"create","payload":{"requestId":"NEW_UUID_FOR_SHORTAGE","displayName":"GM40 QA host","dishCount":20,"mealSlot":"dinner"}}

### Outsider: HTTP200, ok=false, error.messageKey=NOT_MEMBER; no room/ballot data.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/dish_session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{outsiderJwt}}

{"command":"snapshot","payload":{"roomId":"{{roomId}}"}}

### Unauthenticated: HTTP401/403, no room data.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rpc/dish_session
Content-Type: application/json

{"command":"snapshot","payload":{"roomId":"{{roomId}}"}}

# Runner also asserts stage/import/readback, reimport/conflict, fault rollback,
# switch/restore, old locked pool, imported cards through round2/finalize/reconnect,
# legacy fixture IDs/FKs/result and private ACL. Full runner supplies complete pool
# votes privately; this file deliberately contains no actual ballots/tokens.
